Z||000013||Oreif||03-26-2001||09:31 PM||||To check out V-8 Fiero's and a couple of body kits go to: <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com" TARGET=_blank>www.v8archie.com</A> <P>If you happen to be near Illinois on or around April 21, Archie has a big meeting at his shop so you can see first hand how a V-8 goes into a Fiero and usually there is someone with a V-8 Fiero giving rides.||||reg||1
